<title>USA: Liberty Mint names president.</title>
<headline>Liberty Mint names president.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Mint Ltd said on Friday it had named Larry Ruff president, following its acquisition of a majority stake in Liberty Mint Inc.</p>
<p>Liberty Mint Inc shareholders now own a majority and controlling interest in the public company.</p>
<p>Liberty Mint Ltd is now a producer and marketer of commemorative coins and medallians, as a result of the deal.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
